0..47 Comment "/// This source states function extensionality."
48..51 Comment "///"
52..114 Comment "/// Functions form one path when they agree at every argument."
115..192 Comment "/// It is the HoTT book\'s § 2.9 (`Path.funext`) and cubical Agda\'s `funExt`."
193..196 Comment "///"
197..244 Comment "/// Double negation returns each Boolean value."
245..300 Comment "/// Single negation differs from the identity function."
